@startuml
title Staff payment and separate close
start
:Require SERVICE_STAFF;
:Read ACTIVE session and opening price snapshot;
:Calculate adult/child pricing and backend percentage discount;
:Round payable total once HALF_UP;
:Show public display breakdown;
:Read existing Payment;
if (Already recorded?) then (yes)
 :Show recorded amount and status;
else (no)
 :Staff confirms CASH / QR / CARD;
 :Backend recalculates and inserts PAID;
 if (Response unknown?) then (yes)
  :Read status manually;
  if (Confirmed no record?) then (yes)
   :Allow staff to confirm manual retry;
  else (record or read failed)
   :Show recorded result or block retry;
  endif
 endif
endif
:Staff requests close separately;
:Require ACTIVE and matching PAID Payment;
:Complete session and return table AVAILABLE atomically;
stop
@enduml
